# Perft is a separate diagnostic mode with sorted root records and no bestmove.
@phase 4.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< position startpos
< go perft 1
> info string perft move a2a3 nodes 1
> info string perft move a2a4 nodes 1
> info string perft move b1a3 nodes 1
> info string perft move b1c3 nodes 1
> info string perft move b2b3 nodes 1
> info string perft move b2b4 nodes 1
> info string perft move c2c3 nodes 1
> info string perft move c2c4 nodes 1
> info string perft move d2d3 nodes 1
> info string perft move d2d4 nodes 1
> info string perft move e2e3 nodes 1
> info string perft move e2e4 nodes 1
> info string perft move f2f3 nodes 1
> info string perft move f2f4 nodes 1
> info string perft move g1f3 nodes 1
> info string perft move g1h3 nodes 1
> info string perft move g2g3 nodes 1
> info string perft move g2g4 nodes 1
> info string perft move h2h3 nodes 1
> info string perft move h2h4 nodes 1
> info string perft depth 1 nodes 20
! silence 100ms
< go perft 0
> info string perft depth 0 nodes 1
! silence 100ms
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
